# This repo only syncs the "Public stuff" folder, plus explicit
# exceptions below for personal assignment folders.
# Everything else in this working directory is ignored on purpose.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Public stuff/
!Public stuff/**
!The Whistling World Cup/
!The Whistling World Cup/**

# OS / editor junk files, ignored even inside "Public stuff"
**/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store?
**/._*
**/.Spotlight-V100
**/.Trashes
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

# Python bytecode caches, ignored even inside "Public stuff"
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

# Throwaway venv created by virtualTesting/setup_test_env.py, ignored even
# inside "Public stuff"
Public stuff/virtualTesting/test/
